<title>USA: Puget Sound Power merger approved by state.</title>
<headline>Puget Sound Power merger approved by state.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Puget Sound Power &amp; Light Co on Wednesday said the Washington Utilities and Transportation Commission approved its planned merger with Washington Energy Co.</p>
<p>The two companies said their boards of directors would meet separately on Friday to review the commission's order and vote on the merger.</p>
<p>If both boards approved the new company, Puget Sound Energy, could be formed at the close of New York Stock Exchange trading on Monday. If so, it would begin trading on Tuesday under Puget Sound Power's symbol, &quot;PSD.&quot;</p>
</text>
